sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Overview Screen
    participant B as Articles Service
    participant J as Jobs Service

    UI->>B: POST /api/articles/{id}/inspect
    B->>B: create job_id; gate → pending; append TimelineEvent "Inspection started"
    B-->>UI: 202 { jobId: "job_yyy", status: "running" }
    UI->>UI: gate badge → spinner

    Note over B: inspection logic runs (word count ≥ 500 → pass, else warn)
    B->>B: gate = pass | warn | fail; append TimelineEvent "Inspection passed (gate: warn)"
    B->>B: mark job_yyy → done

    loop every 2 s (max 60 s)
        UI->>J: GET /api/jobs/job_yyy
        alt running
            J-->>UI: { status: "running" }
        else done
            J-->>UI: { status: "done", result: { gate: "warn" } }
            UI->>B: GET /api/articles?page=…
            B-->>UI: updated row with gate = warn badge
        end
    end